    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_LaunchFullscreenOnGuide">Press Guide to open Fullscreen</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_LaunchFullscreenOnGuideHelp">Desktop only, and only when no game is running. Hold Guide / PS / Home for about 0.5 seconds and release to open Fullscreen (same as the menu / F11). A short tap is ignored. A long hold (as when powering off the controller) is also ignored. Does nothing if Fullscreen is already open. If Windows is set to open Xbox Game Bar with the controller Guide button, turn that off or both can trigger at once.</sys:String>
